<title>MEXICO: TABLE-Mexico's Alfa 6 mos. net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Mexico's Alfa 6 mos. net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		6-mos 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a			n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  1.862 bln		2.858 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 15.206 bln	     15.469 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     3.972 bln		3.967 bln</p>
